      "title": "Guide — Ziggart FlowHMR 3D Video & Webcam Mocap to VRM Avatar Pipeline",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 14 : ZIGGART FLOWHMR MOCAP TO 3D VRM AVATAR\n1. MODEL LOADER : ZiggartFlowHMRModelLoader manages Motius-FlowHMR-Base / Latest checkpoints, caching them under models/3d/ziggart_mocap.\n2. VIDEO / WEBCAM CAPTURE : Feed any video sequence or use ZiggartFlowHMRWebcamCapture to record live camera takes.\n3. FLOW-MATCHING EXTRACTION : ZiggartFlowHMRVideoExtractor generates 52-joint SMPL-H motion with physics-based contact and root translation without foot sliding.\n4. RETARGET & GROUND LOCK : ZiggartMocapRetargetVRM converts SMPL-H into the 25-bone VRM humanoid hierarchy, clamping ground contact and applying temporal smoothing.\n5. AVATAR MOCAP DRIVE : ZiggartAvatarMocapDrive drives your 3D VRM avatar with the extracted mocap, generating synchronized RGB, Mask, Depth, Normal, and OpenPose passes for video diffusion models (AnimateDiff, Wan2.1, HunyuanVideo)!"
      ],
